Interactive render delegate time changes through a UsdImagingGL.Engine, from python

A sphere whose translation and material color are animated is rendered at different frames, the frame of the render
params of the engine being changed between the renders. The render delegate is driven by a headless
UsdImagingGL.Engine as a viewport does, see testsuite/common/interactive_engine_test.py. Each render is checked in
test.py, and the last one is compared against the reference image.

author: cyril.pichard@autodesk.com

PARAMS: {'script': '"{}" test.py'.format(usd_python)}
